## Symptom

Owner-mismatch strikes can reach the threshold (2) twice within ONE pass: the heartbeat arm (c2c_relay_connector.ml:2638-2651) and poll arm (2834-2848) each bump the same session_id, so heartbeat and poll both seeing the foreign lease drops the cached registration one pass earlier than the documented two consecutive passes - accelerating the register/heartbeat takeover fight in a B295 pair race.

## Fix direction

Count at most one strike per session per pass.

## Evidence

Connector review 2026-09-17.